<title>HONG KONG: HK expects to launch mortgage corp this month - Hui.</title>
<headline>HK expects to launch mortgage corp this month - Hui.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong expects to launch its Mortgage Corp later this month, Rafael Hui, Secretary for Financial Services, told a seminar on Friday.</p>
